# Stable spec ID: morgenthaler-apple-juice-arnold-palmer. Source checked 2026-10-13. Machine generated; not human reviewed or taste-tested.

::ingredients
(apple juice) 16 oz
(black tea) 4 bags
(lemon: juice, fresh) 3 oz
(simple syrup, 2:1 sugar to water) 3 oz

::equipment
(saucepan)
(highball glass)

::instructions
(apple juice) <heat, gently in (saucepan)> ?= around 65C
(black tea) <steep, in hot apple juice> 5min
<remove, tea bags>
<cover> <cool>
(lemon: juice) + (simple syrup) <combine, with cooled apple tea>
<pour, over plenty of ice in (highball glass)>
<garnish, with a lemon wedge>

::notes
This records one source-specific version; no universal formula or automatic product substitution is implied.
Batch makes two large or four small servings. The source’s fruit-juice tea infusion is preserved; do not read these as per-glass quantities.

